  "cards": {
    "lamppost": {
      "title": {
        "zh": "路灯",
        "en": "The lamppost"
      },
      "text": {
        "zh": "中间这根路灯和街道的地平线，把画面分成了四格。路灯也把前景和远处隔开。",
        "en": "The lamppost and the horizon divide the picture into four parts. The lamppost also separates the foreground from the distance."
      }
    },
    "couple": {
      "title": {
        "zh": "前景的一对",
        "en": "The couple"
      },
      "text": {
        "zh": "前景这对撑伞的夫妇，走在都灵街靠近莫斯科街的路口。",
        "en": "The couple in the foreground are walking along the rue de Turin, near its corner with the rue de Moscou."
      }
    },
    "wet": {
      "title": {
        "zh": "湿漉漉的街道",
        "en": "The wet street"
      },
      "text": {
        "zh": "在当时，画雨景很新鲜。卡耶博特借此画出了湿漉漉的石板路上的倒影。",
        "en": "Painting a rainy scene was a new idea at the time. It let Caillebotte paint the reflections on the wet cobblestones."
      }
    },
    "newparis": {
      "title": {
        "zh": "新的巴黎",
        "en": "The new Paris"
      },
      "text": {
        "zh": "画这个路口时，奥斯曼已经把巴黎从中世纪城市改造成了现代首都：宽阔的林荫大道、人行道和下水道。",
        "en": "By the time this was painted, Haussmann had transformed Paris from a medieval city into a modern capital, with broad boulevards, pavements and sewers."
      }
    },
    "winter": {
      "title": {
        "zh": "冬天的下午",
        "en": "A winter afternoon"
      },
      "text": {
        "zh": "艺术史学家认为，画里的光线说明这是一个冬天的下午。",
        "en": "Art historians believe the light shows a winter afternoon."
      }
    },
    "lines": {
      "title": {
        "zh": "清晰的线条",
        "en": "Clear lines"
      },
      "text": {
        "zh": "和其他印象派画家不同，卡耶博特的线条清晰、结构严谨，几乎看不到笔触。",
        "en": "Unlike his fellow Impressionists, Caillebotte used clear lines and a strict structure, with brushstrokes that are barely visible."
      }
    },
    "station": {
      "title": {
        "zh": "火车站旁边",
        "en": "Near the station"
      },
      "text": {
        "zh": "这个路口当时叫莫斯科路口，就在圣拉扎尔火车站东边，今天叫都柏林广场。",
        "en": "This crossroads, then called the Carrefour de Moscou, lies just east of the Gare Saint-Lazare. Today it is the Place de Dublin."
      },
      "link": {
        "scene": "gare-saint-lazare",
        "href": "../gare-saint-lazare/",
        "label": {
          "zh": "莫奈《圣拉扎尔火车站》",
          "en": "Monet's *The Gare Saint-Lazare*"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "exclusive": {
    "_说明": "独家发现“画面的四格”：开关打开后，画面上浮现两条线：中间的路灯（竖线）和街道的地平线（横线），把画面分成四格，并显示卡片“路灯”的文字。lines 写的是线在原画上的位置（0–1），从画家视角投出去；照着 images/paris-street-rainy-day.jpg 量的：路灯在 x=0.49，地平线（远处楼房的底边）在 y=0.42。",
